text.en:
\1) For the discharge of its functions under this Order, the Centre may, from time to time, raise loans from the Government or, with the approval of the Minister of Finance, raise loans from banks or other financial institutions (whether in Brunei Darussalam or elsewhere) by{a) mortgage, overdraft or otherwise;

(b) charge, whether legal or equitable, on any property vested in the or on any other revenue receivable by the Centre under this Order; and {c) the creation and issue of debentures bonds or other instruments.

(2) Subject to the approval of the Minister of Finance, the Centre may invest its funds in such manner as the Minister of Finance thinks fit. powers and duties of Executive Director.
